}
effect_description = "Draws on a well-armored sanctuary and a bonded toad's patient husbandry to make the habitat more bountiful. Mechanical effect not yet wired (see design/gdd/building-upgrade.md Rule 7) — Menagerie is the intended consumer of structure_upgraded for this structure, matching the existing Watchtower upgrade's own disclosed scaffolding-only status."
